{
  "uid": "gpu",
  "title": "GPU replay: Kaggle T4 run 2026-10-09 (nvidia-smi, not live)",
  "tags": [
    "gpu",
    "replay",
    "phase2"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "2026-10-09T05:55:00.000Z",
    "to": "2026-10-09T06:40:00.000Z"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cell",
        "label": "cell",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(gpu_replay_power_watts, cell)",
          "refId": "cell"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(gpu_replay_power_watts, cell)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "allValue": ".*"
      },
      {
        "name": "gpu",
        "label": "gpu",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(gpu_replay_power_watts, gpu)",
          "refId": "gpu"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(gpu_replay_power_watts, gpu)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "allValue": ".*"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this is",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Replay of captured data, not live.** Source: nvidia-smi (not DCGM; DCGM is not available on Kaggle), sampled every 500 ms during each measured benchmark window of the Phase 2 Kaggle run v2.\n\n- Run: `kaggle-20261009`, started 2026-10-09 05:54:36Z, finished 06:33:53Z, 2x Tesla T4 (driver 580.178.04), vLLM 0.31.0.\n- Raw files: `benchmark/results/raw/kaggle-20261009/results/raw/vllm-*/*.json` (`gpu_samples`), committed in c0ad34e; benchmark code at git commit 8c01b3262760b69a0ede5fb0c3ff9bf47e838443 (`env/run.json`).\n- Loaded with `observability/gpu-replay/backfill.sh` (convert.py to OpenMetrics, `promtool tsdb create-blocks-from openmetrics`).\n- Gaps between runs are real: samples exist only inside measured windows (warmup and model loads are not sampled).\n- Power limit 70 W per GPU (`env/nvidia-smi-q.txt`). Memory is MiB from nvidia-smi shown in IEC units.\n\nThe time range is fixed to the run window; widening it shows nothing more.\n\nOther panels show the last sample per display interval. Prometheus keeps 31 days, so this data ages out around 2026-11-09; rerun `observability/gpu-replay/backfill.sh` on a fresh volume or after it expires."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GPU utilization",
      "description": "nvidia-smi utilization.gpu: share of time a kernel was running, not SM occupancy.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(gpu_replay_utilization_percent{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[$__interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cell}} c{{concurrency}} r{{repeat}} gpu{{gpu}}"
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GPU memory used",
      "description": "nvidia-smi memory.used. vLLM preallocates (--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9), so this is flat per cell. T4 total 15360 MiB.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(gpu_replay_memory_used_bytes{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[$__interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cell}} c{{concurrency}} r{{repeat}} gpu{{gpu}}"
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Power vs 70 W limit",
      "description": "nvidia-smi power.draw, highest sample per display interval so short peaks stay visible. Red line: 70 W power limit (env/nvidia-smi-q.txt). Samples above it do occur in the raw data: 100 of 2265 above 70 W, max 81.82 W (7B AWQ, GPU 0, 06:29:18Z). power.draw on a T4 is an instantaneous reading, while the 70 W board limit is enforced on averaged power, so short spikes above it are expected and do not mean the limit was broken.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "watt",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 90,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max_over_time(gpu_replay_power_watts{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[$__interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cell}} c{{concurrency}} r{{repeat}} gpu{{gpu}}"
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SM clock",
      "description": "nvidia-smi clocks.sm. T4 max 1590 MHz.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "hertz",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(gpu_replay_sm_clock_hertz{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[$__interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cell}} c{{concurrency}} r{{repeat}} gpu{{gpu}}"
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Temperature",
      "description": "nvidia-smi temperature.gpu.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "custom": {
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(gpu_replay_temperature_celsius{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[$__interval])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cell}} c{{concurrency}} r{{repeat}} gpu{{gpu}}"
        }
      ],
      "maxDataPoints": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Per run: medians over the measured window",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Instant queries at the end of the dashboard range (06:40Z) over [50m], so each run's whole window is included.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "SM",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, gpu_replay_sm_clock_hertz{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[50m]) / 1e6",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "UTIL",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, gpu_replay_utilization_percent{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[50m])",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "PWR",
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.5, gpu_replay_power_watts{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[50m])",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "MEM",
          "expr": "max_over_time(gpu_replay_memory_used_bytes{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[50m]) / 1048576",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "TEMP",
          "expr": "max_over_time(gpu_replay_temperature_celsius{cell=~\"$cell\",gpu=~\"$gpu\"}[50m])",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "source": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #SM": "SM clock p50 (MHz)",
              "Value #UTIL": "util p50 (%)",
              "Value #PWR": "power p50 (W)",
              "Value #MEM": "memory max (MiB)",
              "Value #TEMP": "temp max (C)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
